# LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Not cosmetic: the shell script inside .github/workflows/docs-parity.yml is written to disk and
# run by bash on the runner. Checked out with CRLF, every line ends in a stray carriage return and
# the job fails with `$'\r': command not found`.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
